{"method":{"methodHash":"7bb15aab497be7290cbf775ddb72c9ef","typeHash":"e4a6a66cfe6c7304f91b9ce2765912cc","name":"BuildFastestFpsCap","filePath":"/Users/pratiksinghthakur/perproj/dotnet/Aimmy/Aimmy2/AILogic/PerformanceBenchmark.cs","bodySpan":{"startLine":560,"startColumn":9,"endLine":569,"endColumn":10},"calls":[{"span":{"startLine":566,"startColumn":26,"endLine":566,"endColumn":83},"calleeMethodHash":"671e30f487fffd6eeb178108608aef38","calleeDisplayName":"Aimmy2.AILogic.PerformanceRecommendationBuilder.Clamp(int, int, int)"},{"span":{"startLine":566,"startColumn":32,"endLine":566,"endColumn":70},"calleeMethodHash":"f9988782da805f3314a543f03ab152ac","calleeDisplayName":"Aimmy2.AILogic.PerformanceRecommendationBuilder.RoundToNearestFive(double)"},{"span":{"startLine":567,"startColumn":35,"endLine":567,"endColumn":83},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"Max"},{"span":{"startLine":567,"startColumn":47,"endLine":567,"endColumn":82},"calleeMethodHash":"bed5d54a7a8f8f5dd67168e4669326ba","calleeDisplayName":"Aimmy2.AILogic.PerformanceRecommendationBuilder.RoundDownToNearestFive(double)"},{"span":{"startLine":568,"startColumn":20,"endLine":568,"endColumn":53},"calleeMethodHash":null,"calleeDisplayName":"Min"}]},"lines":["        private static int BuildFastestFpsCap(double measuredFps)","        {","            if (measuredFps \u003C= 0)","                return 60;","","            int floor = measuredFps \u003E= 80 ? 60 : measuredFps \u003E= 40 ? 30 : 5;","            int target = Clamp(RoundToNearestFive(measuredFps * 0.90), floor, 240);","            int measuredCeiling = Math.Max(5, RoundDownToNearestFive(measuredFps));","            return Math.Min(target, measuredCeiling);","        }"],"startLine":560}